ASK MUEZ Catalogue Update

Preview file: index.html

This package updates the brand model view into a catalogue/gallery page with model image galleries, variant prices and the supplied monthly payment terms. It retains the vehicle selection, estimate and WhatsApp enquiry flow.

Source: internal BAIC / FOTON / ARCFOX price list supplied by the user. Calculated figures are indicative and require bank confirmation. Missing financing terms are not quoted and are not inferred.

The uploaded HTML uses embedded vehicle imagery already present in the source. External AutoPasar image files have not been downloaded into this package.

Not deployed to Netlify; GitHub was not modified.
